## Next Steps
The integration is complete and ready for deployment. Once deployed to Vercel:
1. Enable Speed Insights in the Vercel dashboard for your project
2. Speed Insights will automatically start collecting performance metrics
3. Data will be available in the Speed Insights dashboard after users visit the site

## Notes
- The implementation follows the official Vercel documentation for Next.js 13.5+
